Patch: 0001-turn-scoped-runTurn
Upstream: can1357/oh-my-pi v15.2.4
Owner: xuanpu-agent runtime

Summary:
  Xuanpu adds a runTurn facade around the upstream Agent so a single provider
  request is auditable and replayable. Historical/context messages are loaded
  into the fresh Agent with replaceMessages(). Only the current prompt message
  is sent to agent.prompt().

Contract:
  - context messages do not produce prompt echo events
  - every runTurn call creates a fresh Agent
  - providerSessionState is disabled unless a future replay-capable policy
    explicitly opts in

Implementation:
  See packages/xuanpu-oh-my-pi-runtime/src/agent-loop.ts.
